November&nbsp;6, 2024, 170,000 vest on September&nbsp;16, 2025, 3,855 vest on November&nbsp;6, 2025 and 170,000 vest on September&nbsp;16, 2026. These shares remain subject to forfeiture if the time-based vesting conditions are not satisfied.
Excludes 150,000 shares issuable upon exercise of unvested stock options, 75,000 of which vest on September&nbsp;16, 2025 and 75,000 of which vest on September&nbsp;16, 2026, subject to satisfaction of time-based vesting criteria.
